From 8f3f9adfeb785369b904cd62817a4dde217bcba9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Lothian <mike@fireburn.co.uk>
Date: Mon, 27 Jul 2026 22:21:31 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 02/13] revdi: apply the workspace Rust style

Format the standalone userspace crates with the current Rust formatter. Keep the kernel-vendored sources excluded from cargo fmt so their byte-for-byte sync remains enforceable.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-0
Assisted-by: Codex:gpt-5
Signed-off-by: Mike Lothian <mike@fireburn.co.uk>
